      <activity id="e60e1905-8164-5295-adfe-70c5dc48b2fe" activityNameId="919d68f1-663a-549e-a1d7-d91f222ca72a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Olive pomace, burned in furnace, ash to landfarming</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Olive pomace, burned in furnace, ash to landfarming
Air emission from combustion data  completed with ecoinvent inventory of "logs, mixed, burned in wood heater 6kW";
UUID: fe9db8e7-a37e-39d1-ba9d-43d4ff734d5e
This data set describes the emission into air caused by the combustion, infrastructure, fuelinput and transport are included
Location: The inventory is modelled for a typical production area for olives in the Lythrodontas region in Cyprus.
Technology: Boiler Furnace
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Several air emissions estimated with data for wood combustion.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fe9db8e7-a37e-39d1-ba9d-43d4ff734d5e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
